<h2>Update on Your Application</h2>
<p>Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p>Thank you for applying to <strong><%= @form.title %></strong>.</p>
<p>Unfortunately, we are unable to approve your application at this time.</p>
<% if @submission.admin_note.present? %>
  <p><strong>Note from organizers:</strong> <%= @submission.admin_note %></p>
<% end %>
<p>We appreciate your interest and hope to see you at future events.</p>
<p>The Hometown Team</p>
